{"id":"a7bf11e2f518df7b","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-horn-theory-reduced-products.md","title":"Horn Theories are Closed under Reduced Products","display":"thm-horn-theory-reduced-products — Horn Theories are Closed under Reduced Products","type":"theorem","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_verification":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified","type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-horn-theory-reduced-products","aliases":["17-thm-horn-theory-reduced-products"],"display":"thm-horn-theory-reduced-products — Horn Theories are Closed under Reduced Products","depends_on":["[[17-df-model]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-filter]]","[[17-df-reduced-product]]","[[17-df-horn-formula]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-6.3.3","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-horn-theory-reduced-products"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-horn-theory-reduced-products</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-horn-theory-reduced-products — Horn Theories are Closed under Reduced Products"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3807ab351b0011c6\" href=\"?note=3807ab351b0011c6\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product\">17-df-reduced-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e5b78bfb3887990\" href=\"?note=1e5b78bfb3887990\" title=\"17-df-horn-formula\">17-df-horn-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-6.3.3"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\">\\((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-结构族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>；商的调用要求下式所列非空指标和真滤子前提。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> (class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\\)</span> (proper-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L\\)</span> (reduced-product predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3807ab351b0011c6\" href=\"?note=3807ab351b0011c6\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product\">17-df-reduced-product</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\\)</span> (Horn sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1e5b78bfb3887990\" href=\"?note=1e5b78bfb3887990\" title=\"17-df-horn-formula\">17-df-horn-formula</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;T\\subseteq\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\n\\land\n\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\n\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T))\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L\n\\bigl((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},D,\\mathfrak B\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;T\\subseteq\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\n\\land\n\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\n\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T))\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L\n\\bigl((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},D,\\mathfrak B\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each Horn axiom is preserved by the reduced product, so the whole Horn theory is preserved. Arbitrary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\exists\">\\(\\forall\\exists\\)</span> sentences do not satisfy this conclusion.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本次滤子接口修订：此处显式使用真滤子，与既有约化积构造的定义域一致；原书允许不真滤子的广义定义未在本节点采用。原有来源与证明核验限制继续有效。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduced-product","status":"resolved","id":"3807ab351b0011c6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-reduced-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-horn-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1e5b78bfb3887990","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-horn-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excer